    "html": "<h1>Development</h1>\n<p>The CLI is written in <strong>Go 1.22+</strong> (module <code>github.com/Golmet/golmet-cli</code>),\nwith <a href=\"https://github.com/spf13/cobra\">spf13/cobra</a> as the only external\ndependency. <strong>639 Go tests</strong> (unit + integration + binary e2e) back the\ncurrent state.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">go build ./...                    # build\ngo build -o golmet ./cmd/golmet   # local binary\ngo test ./...                     # tests\ngo vet ./... &amp;&amp; gofmt -l .        # mandatory before committing\n</code></pre>\n",
