    "title": "GLOSSARY — The workflow glossary",
    "html": "<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"glossary.pt-br.md\">Português (Brasil) — versão integral</a> | <a href=\"../../README.md\">English README</a></p><h1>GLOSSARY — The workflow glossary</h1>\n<p>The vocabulary of the workflow: RN, PEND, CR, ADR, Charter, Spec, evidence,\nstale, drift — what each term means and how the entities relate. The\nnormative PT-BR version is the full glossary (the source of truth); the\nEnglish translation is its own wave.</p>\n",
