    "html": "<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"known-errors.pt-br.md\">Português (Brasil) — versão integral</a> | <a href=\"../../README.md\">English README</a></p><h1>KNOWN_ERRORS — Known errors of the workflow</h1>\n<p>The living list of known errors of the workflow: symptom, cause,\nworkaround, status. Re-active only — entries are born from real support\nincidents (never proactively). The normative PT-BR version is the full\nlist.</p>\n",
