    "lang": "en",
    "group": "CLI",
    "title": "Releases",
    "html": "<h1>Releases</h1>\n<h2>v1.7.4 — 24/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(ci)</em> Push the bump commit without mutating the remote</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(release)</em> V1.7.4</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.7.3 — 24/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(ci)</em> Commit the version bump into the repo before tagging</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(versioning)</em> The repo copy now carries the released version</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(cli)</em> Assert version sync invariants instead of the 1.0.0 placeholder</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(release)</em> V1.7.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.7.2 — 23/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(release)</em> Guard the npm version stamp against silent truncation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.7.1 — 23/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(release)</em> Sync optionalDependencies with the tag when publishing the main npm package</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(versioning)</em> Record the v1.0.0 lightweight tag quirk</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(version)</em> Resolve the last tag from HEAD ancestry instead of the global sort</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.7.0 — 23/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🚀 Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(pack)</em> Add pack mcp status/sync for state pack MCP servers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(install)</em> Treat empty engine MCP list in opencode parser</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.6.0 — 23/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🚀 Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(lint)</em> L14 front matter YAML parseable check</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(coredata)</em> Quote gm-dba description value</li>\n<li><em>(lint)</em> Kit-mode walkers recurse into packs (L11/L12/L14)</li>\n<li><em>(eval)</em> Check details reflect the real outcome</li>\n<li><em>(lint)</em> Kit-mode pack walkers skip evals/testdata</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(format)</em> Fix merged-fragment corruption, L1-L14 sweep, migration skip note</li>\n<li><em>(lint)</em> L1 does not sweep pack .md files - align reference with code</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(eval)</em> Detail assertions for not_file_exists and frontmatter_valid</li>\n<li><em>(lint)</em> MdFilesDeep direct unit + local threat-model note</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.5.0 — 21/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🚀 Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(dev-verdicts)</em> Calibrated gray-zone verdicts for QA and reviewer via Jev questions library</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(review)</em> Inline default questions - core must not point at org pack paths</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Regenerate goldens for QA and reviewer agents after source edits</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.4.0 — 21/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🚀 Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(setup)</em> Compose org rules lazy index from pack rule headers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(setup)</em> Org-pack block goes generic - rule inventory lives in the composed lazy index</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.3.0 — 21/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🚀 Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(evals)</em> Fixture-002 de variante/erro nas 10 skills do ciclo diario</li>\n<li><em>(knowledge-graph)</em> Implementa o script deterministico da gm-knowledge-graph (IMP-008)</li>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Porta do motor do grafo de conhecimento para Go — golmet graph + gm_graph (ADR-019)</li>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Setas direcionais escalaveis com fluxo animado + linker indice_lazy p/ registries yaml</li>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Painel de vizinhos agrupado por direcao e tipo de relacao</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Painel de vizinhos com direcao relativa e voz inversa</li>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Contraste dos prefixos do painel de vizinhos</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Referencia do sistema de evals bilíngue + runner correto no golden-human</li>\n<li>Retrospectiva do lançamento v1.0.0 - v1.1.1 (scorecard IMP-048: 8.3)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Convencao pertence_a (componente -&gt; container) substitui agrega</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🎨 Styling</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(graph)</em> Gofmt nos arquivos do motor do grafo</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(evals)</em> Re-baseline do golden fixture-001 (gm-knowledge-graph) - motor Go com setas, pertence_a e painel agrupado</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.2.2 — 21/11/2026</h2>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(lint)</em> L6/L1 resolvem gm-* contra kit + org, nao so o registry do binario</li>\n</ul>\n",
