    "html": "<h1>Roadmap · Contributing · License</h1>\n<p>The milestone plan lives in <a href=\"ROADMAP.md\">ROADMAP.md</a> (F1 = this release; F2\n= the docs site; F3 = the contribute flow and workspace migration).\nContributing: <a href=\"CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a> — table-driven tests and\n<code>gofmt</code> are mandatory. License <a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a>.</p>\n",
